# Final Evolution Group — Marketing Website
# ============================================
# This site currently requires NO environment variables.
# All content is statically rendered at build time.
#
# If you add API integrations in the future, define them here
# prefixed with VITE_ so Vite exposes them to the client:
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.finalevolutiongroup.com
# VITE_ANALYTICS_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
# VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_xxxxx
